OL,3,GNEWSAScrapping of surgery bus
OL,4,Adisappointing, says GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GP surgery has said it is
OL,7,Fdisappointed a council is scrapping a
OL,8,Fbus service introduced less than a year
OL,9,Fago to help get patients to
OL,10,Fappointments.
OL,12,FCumberland Council announced it would
OL,13,Fno longer fund the DR1 service from
OL,14,FCarlisle city centre to Carlisle
OL,15,FHealthcare's South surgery on Locke
OL,16,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
