OL,3,GNEWSAScrapping of surgery bus
OL,4,Adisappointing, says GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bus was introduced in January using
OL,7,Fpart of a #3.5m government pot
OL,8,Ffollowing a petition, but the
OL,9,FLabour-led authority decided its last
OL,10,Fservice would be on 31 December due to
OL,11,Flow passenger numbers.
OL,13,FGP partner at Carlisle Healthcare Dr
OL,14,FRobert Westgate said the surgery had
OL,15,Fhoped the bus would become "an
OL,16,Fincreasingly useful option for
OL,17,Fpatients".
